//Mails
  "orochifrogu.VeganValley_pumpkincurry_Recipe": "Hey, @. You look like you need some vegetables in your diet.^Lookin' a little pale. Yeah how about you try this dish out?^Lots of beta-carotene will have you looking bright again.^		-Secret Vegan Admirer. %item cookingRecipe orochifrogu.VeganValley_pumpkincurry%%[#]Pumpkin Curry Recipe",
  
  "orochifrogu.VeganValley_vegancurry_Recipe": "I've noticed your fridge. Got some extra 'summer squash' don't ya?^Yep, I think I've got just the thing for you. Save me a bowl, would you?^I'll come by and pick it up later.^		-Secret Vegan Admirer. %item cookingRecipe orochifrogu.VeganValley_vegancurry%%[#]Vegan Curry Recipe",
				
  "orochifrogu.VeganValley_dishotheday_Recipe": "So, @, you're getting lazy?^Well, lucky for you this dish is simple as it comes. Seriously.^Just a bit of rice, pop in a broccoli, and a touch of tomato sauce on top, you've got a perfect meal good for any situation.^		-Secret Vegan Admirer. %item cookingRecipe orochifrogu.VeganValley_dishotheday%%[#]Dish 'o' the Day Recipe",
				
  "orochifrogu.VeganValley_stirfry_Recipe": "Yep, I learnt this one duing my travels.^Pelican town doesn't have flavor like this.^Don't tell Gus I've said that, okay?^Anyways, throw any 'ol veg in a pan and with my secret noodles, you'll be satisfied all night.^		-Secret Vegan Admirer. %item cookingRecipe orochifrogu.VeganValley_stirfry%%[#]Noodle Stir Fry Recipe",
				
  "orochifrogu.VeganValley_roastedcauliflower_Recipe": "Jodi really likes this one.  Just lettin' ya know.^Don't tell her the secret ingredient though, okay?^Let's keep this between us.^		-Secret Vegan Admirer. %item cookingRecipe orochifrogu.VeganValley_roastedcauliflower%%[#]Roasted Cauliflower Recipe",
                
  "orochifrogu.VeganValley_roastedcarrots_Recipe": "Are you sweet, or are you spicy, @?^I'm only kidding, I know you better than to ask.^This recipe is right up your alley.^Perfectly sweet and spicy, just like you.^		-Secret Vegan Admirer. %item cookingRecipe orochifrogu.VeganValley_roastedcarrots%%[#]Roasted Carrots Recipe",
				
  "orochifrogu.VeganValley_greencurry_Recipe": "Good things come in green packages, have you heard, @?^This is one for the books. The recipe books.^Vegan food is the best, and this is the best of the best.^That's right, you'll love this one.^		-Secret Vegan Admirer. %item cookingRecipe orochifrogu.VeganValley_greencurry%%[#]Green Curry Recipe",
				
  "orochifrogu.VeganValley_vegantaco_Recipe": "Ever want your vegan salad all wrapped up in a tortilla?^Yeah, I know you do. I read your journal.^Well, this one is crafted just for you.^Keep this taco away from Gus or he might fall in love with you.		-Secret Vegan Admirer. %item cookingRecipe orochifrogu.VeganValley_vegantaco%%[#]Vegan Taco Recipe",
				
  "orochifrogu.VeganValley_harvestsalad_Recipe": "Yep. Salad's are a vegan's best friend.^So many combinations, so little time.^Well, this one is really only good for the fall, unless you stockpile your vegetables.^I haven't been able to sneak into your basement to check yet.^		-Secret Vegan Admirer. %item cookingRecipe orochifrogu.VeganValley_harvestsalad%%[#]Harvest Salad Recipe",
				
  "orochifrogu.VeganValley_bananapancakes_Recipe": "Turn your stove on and get ready. You might be spicy, but I know you prefer sweets.^Yep, come on, turn around, go to your kitchen, and cook this.^		-Secret Vegan Admirer. %item cookingRecipe orochifrogu.VeganValley_bananapancakes%%[#]Banana Pancakes Recipe",
				
  "orochifrogu.VeganValley_lilvegancake_Recipe": "If it was your birthday, I would make this recipe for you. Sweet, cute, and full of juicy strawberries.^I've seen the way you chomp those berries in the spring.^Don't be ashamed, fruit is the most important element of a vegan diet.^Bake this up and think of me, okay, @?^		-Secret Vegan Admirer. %item cookingRecipe orochifrogu.VeganValley_lilvegancake%%[#]Lil Vegan Cake Recipe",
				
  "orochifrogu.VeganValley_pineapplecake_Recipe": "Yeah you're going to want to keep those pineapples of yours set aside.^This cake will knock your socks off.^It's almost as sweet as you.^		-Secret Vegan Admirer. %item cookingRecipe orochifrogu.VeganValley_pineapplecake%%[#]Pineapple Cake Recipe",
				
  "orochifrogu.VeganValley_healthysalad_Recipe": "The vegan selection in town is slim pickin's.^Us vegans need to make sure we're always tinkering with our cooking skill.^Well, you've already got that, so I think I can give you a new recipe. Here you go, @.^		-Secret Vegan Admirer. %item cookingRecipe orochifrogu.VeganValley_healthysalad%%[#]Healthy Salad Recipe",
              
  "orochifrogu.VeganValley_summersalad_Recipe": "So, I heard you want to know the way to Haley's heart.^Not sure why you'd want that, considering I'm right *here* but, whatever.^I care about you, and I want to spread the vegan love, so.... here you go.^		-Secret Vegan Admirer. %item cookingRecipe orochifrogu.VeganValley_summersalad%%[#]Summer Salad Recipe",
				
  "orochifrogu.VeganValley_applesauce_Recipe": "You're gonna need to know how to make this if you want to have a happy vegan life.^Yep, this golden sauce is the key to Vegan Baking.^I'll show you the ropes, just hold on tight and plant those apple trees.^		-Secret Vegan Admirer. %item cookingRecipe orochifrogu.VeganValley_applesauce%%[#]Applesauce Recipe",
				
  "orochifrogu.VeganValley_supersalsa_Recipe": "Oh, man, this one's a big boy.^bright, zingy, and BAM in your mouth.^Just wait and see, you're going to love it.^And it's the key to Vegan Tacos, which I hope you'll stick around to make, too, @.^		-Secret Vegan Admirer. %item cookingRecipe orochifrogu.VeganValley_supersalsa%%[#]Super Salsa Recipe",
				
  "orochifrogu.VeganValley_nicecream_Recipe": "Ice cream? Oh no, no NO, @. It's NICE cream.^Nice because it's healthy, sweet, and makes you feel great!^I bet you'd feel great.... if we met.^Well, here's the recipe.^		-Secret Vegan Admirer. %item cookingRecipe orochifrogu.VeganValley_nicecream%%[#]Nice Cream Recipe",
				
  "orochifrogu.VeganValley_strawberrynicecream_Recipe": "Yeah I know how much you love a sweet, creamy, dessert.^And, here's yet another cruelty-free, health-ful dish that'll make you feel like farming 'till two A.M.!^Enjoy this one, @. Think of me.^		-Secret Vegan Admirer. %item cookingRecipe orochifrogu.VeganValley_strawberrynicecream%%[#]Strawberry Nice Cream Recipe",
				
  "orochifrogu.VeganValley_mangomakiroll_Recipe": "Another one of my secret recipes.^The townsfolk are goin' to love this one, too, @.^Sweet, umami, savory.^Bright, healthy, happy.^This is a dish that'll heal your soul and spread joy all around.^Save some for me, 'kay?^		-Secret Vegan Admirer. %item cookingRecipe orochifrogu.VeganValley_mangomakiroll%%[#]Mango Maki Roll Recipe",
				
  "orochifrogu.VeganValley_vegansushi_Recipe": "Oh, @, this one's gonna make you jump.^The energy you'll feel after this dish is... immaculate!^Consider this: a warm, sunny, day. a fresh vegan roll in your hand.^It's crunchy, spicy, and oh-so-savoury.^Yep, make a couple extra, and toss 'em over the fence, okay?^I'll pick 'em up later.^		-Secret Vegan Admirer. %item cookingRecipe orochifrogu.VeganValley_vegansushi%%[#]Vegan Sushi Recipe",
				
  "orochifrogu.VeganValley_ricenoodles_Recipe": "You're @, right?^Yeah, it's good to meet you.^I sense your inner-vegan awakening. It's making me.... feel close to you.^Let me be your guide on your vegan journey.^But first, I need to test your skill.^This is an easy one, so I expect it to be done perfectly. If you manage it, OH, I'm gonna ROCK your vegan world.^		-Secret Vegan Admirer. %item cookingRecipe orochifrogu.VeganValley_ricenoodles%%[#]Rice Noodles Recipe",
  
  "orochifrogu.VeganValley_daddysrecipe_Recipe": "Daddy's finally ready to show you something, @.^If you share this recipe with anybody, I'm going to get you.^Heh. Heh.^I'm only joking.^Maybe.^You don't want to find out.^       -Secret Vegan Admirer. %item cookingRecipe orochifrogu.VeganValley_daddysrecipe%%[#]Daddy's Recipe Recipe",

  "orochifrogu.VeganValley_mommycookies_Recipe": "Are you okay, @?^Do you miss your mommy?^Come here, reaaaallll close. Ok. Let me show you something extra special.^Mommy uses a special ingredient to make these cookies so tasty. How about you make them and share some with me?^I miss mommy too. Your mommy.^     -Secret Vegan Admirer. %item cookingRecipe orochifrogu.VeganValley_mommycookies%%[#]Mommy's Cookies Recipe",

  "orochifrogu.VeganValley_carrotmuffin_Recipe": "I'm just going to say it.^I busted on this muffin. It's vegan though don't worry.^ I'm in your bushes watching you read this so that I can assess your reaction. Give me a heart emote if you like it.^I'm not very good at reading the room.^    -Secret Vegan Admirer. %item cookingRecipe orochifrogu.VeganValley_carrotmuffin%%[#]Carrot Muffin Recipe",

  "orochifrogu.VeganValley_acaibowl_Recipe": "Hey. It's @, right?^Yeah I'm trying out something new. It's called being 'nonchalant'. Am I doing it right?^Anyways, baby, I got something real nice for you.^It's great for the figure. But, you're already set on that.^I like watching you farm.^I get sad in the wintertime. How about you plant some more fiber seeds this year?..... Powdermelon??... Anything?^I need you.^    -Secret Vegan Admirer. %item cookingRecipe orochifrogu.VeganValley_acaibowl%%[#]Acai Bowl Recipe",

  "orochifrogu.VeganValley_vlt_Recipe": "Ahhhh, the good 'ol V.L.T.^You've been a good little farmer so how about you let me treat you.^In this world, we gotta keep a few secrets, so I won't be telling you what the 'V' stands for.^Taste it and find out, sweetiepie.^    -Secret Vegan Admirer. %item cookingRecipe orochifrogu.VeganValley_vlt%%[#]V.L.T Recipe",

  "orochifrogu.VeganValley_cinnamonroll_Recipe": "You look like you could use something creamy, warm, and sweet.^I can help you with that.^All for you, my sweet.^    -Secret Vegan Admirer. %item cookingRecipe orochifrogu.VeganValley_cinnamonroll%%[#]Cinnamon Roll Recipe"
